{"role": "user", "content": "What can you do?"}
{"role": "assistant", "content": "I can help you with various tasks on your laptop, including:\n\n1. Opening and controlling applications\n2. Sending messages and making calls\n3. Managing your calendar and contacts\n4. Playing and controlling music\n5. Browsing the web and searching for information\n6. Controlling your system (shutdown, restart, etc.)\n7. Typing and keyboard control\n8. File management\n\nJust tell me what you'd like me to do!"}
{"role": "user", "content": "How do I send a message?"}
{"role": "assistant", "content": "You can send messages using commands like:\n\n- \"Send message to [name] on WhatsApp saying [your message]\"\n- \"Send SMS to [name] saying [your message]\"\n- \"Send email to [email address] subject [subject] body [message]\"\n\nFor example: \"Send message to John on WhatsApp saying I'll be there in 10 minutes\""}
